# @LAMDERA release build leftovers. githash stamps `lamdera --version-full` with -dirty
# when `git status --porcelain` lists anything (untracked files included), so whatever a
# build writes into the checkout before extra/Lamdera/Version.hs compiles must be ignored.
# cabal builds (the Linux musl builds), incl. the language-glsl source-repository-package clone
